From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Martijn Muijsers <martijnmuijsers@live.nl>
Date: Mon, 4 Aug 2025 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Preserve teleport command rotation

Adapted from PaperMC/Folia PR #395. TeleportUtils already calculates the yaw
and pitch selected by the command but Folia's async handoff discarded both by
passing null. Forward them into teleportAsync so `/tp` preserves/uses the same
rotation the command resolved.


diff --git a/io/papermc/paper/threadedregions/TeleportUtils.java b/io/papermc/paper/threadedregions/TeleportUtils.java
--- a/io/papermc/paper/threadedregions/TeleportUtils.java
+++ b/io/papermc/paper/threadedregions/TeleportUtils.java
@@ -48,7 +48,7 @@ public final class TeleportUtils {
                             return;
                         }
                         (useFromRootVehicle ? realFrom.getRootVehicle() : realFrom).teleportAsync(
-                            ((CraftWorld)loc.getWorld()).getHandle(), pos, null, null, null,
+                            ((CraftWorld)loc.getWorld()).getHandle(), pos, yaw, pitch, null,
                             cause, teleportFlags, onComplete
                         );
                     },
